Herdrbar

The app icon (Icon.icns) and the menu bar glyph (Sources/Herdrbar/Resources/MenuBarIcon.pdf) are
made from herdr's logo, https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr/blob/main/assets/logo.svg, which is
distributed under the Apache License 2.0. Scripts/make_icons.py regenerates both from that file.

The herdr name and logo belong to the herdr project. Herdrbar is an unofficial companion app and is
not affiliated with herdr.
